#: data/unboxing.metainfo.xml.in:10 data/unboxing.desktop.in:3
msgid "Unboxing"
msgstr "Unboxing"

#: data/unboxing.metainfo.xml.in:11 data/unboxing.desktop.in:4
msgid "Install apps downloaded from the Internet"
msgstr "Instaliraj s interneta preuzete aplikacije"

#: data/unboxing.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid ""
"Handle for you the installation of downloaded Deb packages for Ubuntu and "
"their dependencies. Simply double-click, confirm, enter your password, and "
"wait. Note that while the app is intended to mirror Sideload, and thought as "
"a fallback to install from deprecated packaging, it comes from a third "
"party, and not from the elementary OS team. Please do not file any issue "
"related to this app and its use to them. It may be more than enough for one "
"single stray package, and to help out people uncomfortable with the "
"terminal, but any more advanced function will be better served by the "
"commandline. Make sure to install only packages that are intended for your "
"version of elementary OS or its underlying Ubuntu version, and which are not "
"distributed in AppCenter elementary OS 7: Ubuntu 22.04 LTS elementary OS 8: "
"Ubuntu 24.04 LTS If you like this application please do not hesitate to do a "
"donation. This takes a lot of time, and is done to help people."
msgstr ""
"Sredi instalaciju preuzetih Deb paketa za Ubuntu i njihovih zavisnosti. "
"Jednostavno klikni dvaput, potvrdi, upiši lozinku i pričekaj. Imaj na umu da "
"je aplikacija zamišljena kao alternativa Sideloadu i kao rezervna opcija za "
"instalaciju zastarjelih paketa, ali dolazi od treće strane, a ne od "
"elementary OS tima. Zato njima nemoj prijavljivati probleme vezane uz ovu "
"aplikaciju i njezino korištenje. Može biti sasvim dovoljno za pokoji "
"„zalutali” paket i za ljude kojima terminal nije baš drag. Za bilo što "
"naprednije je ipak bolje koristiti naredben i redak. Instaliraj samo pakete "
"koji su namijenjeni tvojoj verziji elementary OS-a ili odgovarajućoj verziji "
"Ubuntua, i koji nisu dostupni u AppCenteru: elementary OS 7: Ubuntu 22.04 "
"LTS i elementary OS 8: Ubuntu 24.04 LTS. Ako ti se ova aplikacija sviđa, "
"slobodno doniraj. Razvoj zahtijeva puno vremena, a aplikacija je napravljena "
"kako bi ljudima olakšala posao."

